      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il faut les arrêter, sinon, je crains le pire pour\nExtra Illumis !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C002000660061007500740020006C00650073002000610072007200EA007400650072002C002000730069006E006F006E002C0020006A006500200063007200610069006E00730020006C00650020007000690072006500200070006F00750072000A0045007800740072006100200049006C006C0075006D006900730020002100100002011401D90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mets fin à cette baston Méga-Ferox entre\nces deux Crabominable Méga-Ferox ! Je t’en prie !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pour arrêter cette baston Méga-Ferox, tu dois\nvaincre les deux Crabominable Méga-Ferox !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu as réussi à arrêter la baston Méga-Ferox entre\nles deux Crabominable Méga-Ferox ?<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nÇa alors ! Tu n’es pas un<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse ordinaire !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 152
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je n’en crois pas mes yeux...\nC’est une Crabominablite ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006E20190065006E002000630072006F0069007300200070006100730020006D0065007300200079006500750078002E002E002E000A0043201900650073007400200075006E006500200043007200610062006F006D0069006E00610062006C0069007400650020003F00100002011401D90000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu savais que les Crabominable étaient compétitifs\net avaient tendance à frapper avant de réfléchir ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 106
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas étonnant que ces deux-là aient fini par\nprovoquer une baston Méga-Ferox...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En tout cas, pour avoir réussi à arrêter deux\nCrabominable Méga-Ferox, tu dois vraiment être<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nun<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿĀe Dresseu<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȁrse méga-exceptionnel<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿȀle !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǙ",
